Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.47,0:00:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Namaku Hanaori Meteor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.30,0:00:06.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mantan pahlawan dari dunia lain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:08.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setelah mengalahkan Raja Iblis,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.18,0:00:11.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}banyak hal terjadi dan membuatku\Nbereinkarnasi ke dunia ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.14,0:00:15.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku pahlawan cantik, terkuat,\Ndan tak terkalahkan di zaman modern.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.62,0:00:19.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, bahkan seorang pahlawan\Nsepertiku punya kelemahan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.96,0:00:24.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hari ini mapel praktik memasak, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.71,0:00:26.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu bisa masak, Meteor?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.80,0:00:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak suka sayuran.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.57,0:00:31.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak tanya itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.41,0:02:05.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak suka sayuran?\NMemangnya kamu Tyrannosaurus?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.74,0:02:07.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan asal nyeletuk!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.07,0:02:10.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tupai!\NTupai mungil yang cuma makan biji-bijian!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.53,0:02:13.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengan sifatmu yang begitu,\Nmustahil kamu tupai.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.15,0:02:15.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kertas hijau itu bukan makanan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:18.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terutama iblis merah yang bulat itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.64,0:02:21.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Minta maaf pada sayuran, Tupai Mungil.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.45,0:02:25.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tomath.\NMonster yang suka usil.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.17,0:02:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka bisa terbang\Ndan menyerang berkelompok.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.30,0:02:30.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka menyerang dengan cara\Nmenabrakkan tubuhnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.78,0:02:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau melawan Tomath,\Ntubuhku penuh cairan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.54,0:02:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Isi perutnya berhamburan!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.74,0:02:43.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ternyata pahlawan sempurna sepertiku\Njuga punya kelemahan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.02,0:02:44.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa kelemahanmu?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.56,0:02:47.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagi pula, tanpa wifi, kamu itu payah, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.82,0:02:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kejam! Itu kelemahan\Nsemua orang zaman modern!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.50,0:02:53.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cuma kamu yang absen\Nkarena paket data habis.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.18,0:03:00.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski tidak ada wifi,\Nsetidaknya aku bisa menyiram bunga.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.37,0:03:02.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tempo hari bunga mint\Nyang kamu tanam itu mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.40,0:03:05.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Malah nangis!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.68,0:03:11.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kelompok kita juga akan hidangkan\Nke Narukami-sensei! Semangat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.13,0:03:12.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semangat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.95,0:03:17.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini kesempatan bagus, masak makanan\Nyang enak dan buat dia kaget.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.44,0:03:22.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu benar!\NDalam pertarungan ini, aku yang menang!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.85,0:03:24.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebenarnya kamu sedang melawan apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.31,0:03:29.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, ternyata kamu lumayan mahir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.52,0:03:32.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setidaknya aku bisa\Nmemasak sendiri dan berkemah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.30,0:03:34.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga bisa pakai pisau dapur\Ndengan benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.38,0:03:36.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak disangka...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.30,0:03:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memangnya kamu menganggapku apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.60,0:03:41.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wanita payah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.08,0:03:43.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, aku tak bisa bantu apa pun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.64,0:03:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wanita payah itu dia!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.33,0:03:48.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi kalau makan, aku pede.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.18,0:03:49.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Matsurika!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.42,0:03:50.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang aku ingin makan susyi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.88,0:03:52.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Matsurika!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.12,0:04:02.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Para penyihir dan alien, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.69,0:04:05.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semuanya terasa rumit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.10,0:04:08.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebenarnya apa yang sedang terjadi?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.37,0:04:13.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang paling membuatku\Npenasaran itu sihir mereka.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.34,0:04:14.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.40,0:04:17.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rapalan sihir dan tongkat sihir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.18,0:04:20.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rapalannya mirip sihir bahasa kuno.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.87,0:04:23.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi penasaran!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.33,0:04:25.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.36,0:04:27.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kutanya,\Nmereka akan beri tahu tidak, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.23,0:04:28.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ryusei!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.84,0:04:32.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, Hanaori-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.99,0:04:35.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dari tadi aku memanggilmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.31,0:04:37.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, aku sedang memikirkan sesuatu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.55,0:04:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini, bento yang kami buat\Nsaat mapel praktik memasak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.01,0:04:43.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih.\NBagaimana hasilnya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.41,0:04:44.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.19,0:04:49.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bekal suci ini pasti akan\Nmembuat Raja Iblis mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.52,0:04:51.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan bilang hal seram\Ndengan wajah serius.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.05,0:04:54.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana kalau sekalian\Nkita makan di atap?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.15,0:04:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga dibuatkan bekal\Ndan dimintai pendapatmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.54,0:05:00.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Boleh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.34,0:05:04.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana rasanya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.70,0:05:06.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini enak.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.80,0:05:08.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akan kusampaikan pendapatmu ke semuanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.42,0:05:12.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tamagoyaki ini, bumbunya sesuai seleraku.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.58,0:05:14.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Syukurlah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.22,0:05:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makanan di dunia ini memang enak, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.11,0:05:21.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.10,0:05:26.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa harus kucoba semua makanan\Nsebelum mati?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.38,0:05:29.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi niatmu ingin coba\Nsemua jenis makanan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.10,0:05:30.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di dunia kita pun,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.64,0:05:31.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}teknologi berkembang.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.68,0:05:33.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin rasanya jadi lebih enak juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.85,0:05:36.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi di dunia ini jauh berbeda, ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.13,0:05:38.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.01,0:05:41.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, iya, kamu tidak suka makanan apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.78,0:05:43.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Paprika hijau.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.10,0:05:45.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, pimas, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.16,0:05:46.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pimas.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.64,0:05:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Monster yang menyamar sebagai tanaman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.00,0:05:51.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pertahanan dan kekuatannya rendah,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.60,0:05:54.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi mereka merepotkan karena menyerang\Npetualang secara berkelompok.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.22,0:05:56.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pimas.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.83,0:06:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di dalam kulit luarnya, ada wajah asli mereka\Ndi bagan organ dalam.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.01,0:06:04.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Si Hijau yang Jahat, Pimas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.22,0:06:07.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, iya, makanan pokok Raja Iblis itu apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.97,0:06:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Miasma.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.64,0:06:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau makanan pokok pahlawan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.18,0:06:13.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Roti keras yang hambar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.12,0:06:19.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa sangka, ada momen aku bisa makan enak\Ndi bawah langit yang damai.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.74,0:06:21.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rasanya seperti mimpi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.63,0:06:23.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.01,0:06:25.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini kedamaian yang selama ini kita dambakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.66,0:06:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi kemarin ada monster muncul.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.14,0:06:31.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita serahkan saja pada para penyihir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.95,0:06:33.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Malah mengandalkan orang lain!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.45,0:06:36.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Damai, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.52,0:06:38.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi ada monster muncul.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.67,0:06:42.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku kembali.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.05,0:06:43.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.73,0:06:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia bilang enak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.10,0:06:46.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sukses!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.26,0:06:47.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.47,0:06:49.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makanan apa yang paling dia puji?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.66,0:06:51.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rahasia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.91,0:06:53.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi malu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.25,0:06:55.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukannya kamu tidak bantu apa-apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.19,0:06:59.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh, Ryusei!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.29,0:07:02.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku dapat informasi luar biasa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.10,0:07:05.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Suasana hati Meteor sedang bagus!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.26,0:07:09.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Firasatku tidak enak.\NIni tanda bahaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.67,0:07:13.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Katanya di dekat sini ada dungeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.95,0:07:16.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dugaanku benar!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.25,0:07:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Proyek bawah tanah dan kereta bawah tanah\Ndi sekitar Stasiun Mitsurugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.93,0:07:27.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kabarnya di sini terjadi sesuatu\Nyang membuat proyeknya terhenti.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.02,0:07:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mirip dungeon, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.39,0:07:32.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar juga.\NNamanya Eater, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.08,0:07:34.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada kemungkinan mereka bersembunyi di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.98,0:07:39.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di luar dugaan,\Ntempat ini luas dan gelap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.90,0:07:42.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu sendiri yang bilang\Nini mirip dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.42,0:07:43.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berisik.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.44,0:07:44.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.80,0:07:47.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dari tadi ponselku tidak dapat sinyal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.09,0:07:48.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini kan di bawah tanah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.94,0:07:51.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita juga tak tahu jalan pulang!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.61,0:07:54.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan-jangan kita tersesat?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.86,0:07:57.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan jangan-jangan, kita memang tersesat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.21,0:08:01.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setelah dilihat lagi,\Nlorong bawah tanah ini seram, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.60,0:08:04.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gawat!\NBagaimana kalau tiba-tiba muncul rakun?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.11,0:08:06.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Abaikan saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.32,0:08:08.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ke mana nyali besarmu barusan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.69,0:08:11.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa setelah pulang sekolah
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.07,0:08:13.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kita malah ke sini?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.18,0:08:15.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harusnya aku yang bilang begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.06,0:08:17.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku capek.\NGendong aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.70,0:08:20.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu ini bicara apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.40,0:08:22.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau masuk dungeon,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.43,0:08:24.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kita harusnya dengan banyak orang.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.75,0:08:28.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biasanya para petualang\Nmenghadapi dungeon seperti apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.80,0:08:33.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hm, kalau dungeon biasa,\Nbiasanya lima atau enam orang.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.10,0:08:36.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kadang kami tak bisa kembali\Nselama beberapa hari.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.25,0:08:40.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau tempat ini dungeon betulan\Ntempat para monster tinggal...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.38,0:08:42.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin kita juga harus\Nmengumpulkan rekan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.96,0:08:46.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau cari rekan, mungkin akan kuajak\NBattle Fighter Kensuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.67,0:08:48.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia siapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.30,0:08:50.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, mungkin Anjing Semesta.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.42,0:08:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wansa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.34,0:08:52.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin ajak anjing saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.89,0:08:54.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Capek.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.70,0:08:55.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lelah, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.92,0:08:58.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Istirahat dulu sebentar, tapi jangan tidur!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.43,0:09:00.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu, saking santainya,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.73,0:09:02.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}bentukmu jadi coretan gambar!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.16,0:09:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak apa-apa!\NTidak ada yang lihat juga!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.81,0:09:09.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masalahnya bukan soal\Nada yang lihat atau tidak!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.58,0:09:13.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gadis itu jadi cantik\Nkarena dilihat orang-orang!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.85,0:09:15.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Balik tidur lagi saja!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.41,0:09:19.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gelap, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.57,0:09:21.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hati-hati juga jalannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.28,0:09:22.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tulangku serasa remuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.70,0:09:23.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tulangmu?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.71,0:09:26.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh, bagaimana menurutmu soal Eater?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.42,0:09:30.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka bilang itu alien\Nyang datang dari planet lain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.88,0:09:33.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Penyihir melawan alien...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.88,0:09:35.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa dunia ini sedang kacau?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.34,0:09:39.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dunia lain, luar angkasa, alien...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.22,0:09:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Skalanya terlalu besar\Nsampai membuatku gagal paham.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.96,0:09:46.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untuk sekarang, kita tak punya perlengkapan\Natau pengetahuan tentang musuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.58,0:09:47.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan lengah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.82,0:09:51.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Musuh sang pahlawan\Nberikutnya itu alien, ya? Seru juga!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.54,0:09:53.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pahlawan, kamu dengar?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.78,0:10:00.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sepulang sekolah...\NPria dan wanita jalan berdua
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.48,0:10:02.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Malah seperti kencan, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.30,0:10:05.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan-jangan ini kencan dungeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.46,0:10:07.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terlebih, berduaan di tempat gelap!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.97,0:10:11.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Situasi ini bisa membuat perasaan\Njadi salah paham! Apa ini jebakan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.20,0:10:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar Raja Iblis, dia pakai cara licik!\NTak akan kumaafkan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.74,0:10:18.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagi pula, apa itu kencan dungeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.21,0:10:20.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku gagal paham...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.86,0:10:25.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia pasti memikirkan hal aneh lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.84,0:10:30.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimanapun, aku gagal paham.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.18,0:10:32.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kencan dungeon benar-benar misterius.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.69,0:10:37.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jenuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.68,0:10:39.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebenarnya kamu maunya apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.95,0:10:42.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga tidak tahu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.35,0:10:43.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu malah seenaknya!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.01,0:10:46.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak tahu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.50,0:10:47.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.75,0:10:51.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa aku harus melawan monster\Nsebagai pahlawan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.26,0:10:54.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa aku harus menikmati kedamaian ini\Nsebagai siswi SMA?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.80,0:10:57.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa aku harus menahan\Nkekuatan pahlawanku?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.62,0:11:00.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Atau menggunakannya demi orang-orang?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.91,0:11:03.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa aku harus melawan Raja Iblis?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.94,0:11:06.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Atau melupakan semuanya begitu saja?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.26,0:11:10.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu yang terus membuatku bimbang.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.19,0:11:15.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa sebenarnya diriku?\NApa arti dari menjadi pahlawan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.54,0:11:18.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mana mungkin aku tahu itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.16,0:11:21.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, itu masa puber.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.66,0:11:23.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kurasa bukan begitu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.31,0:11:26.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tahu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.50,0:11:31.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu selalu kuat, cerdas,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.21,0:11:36.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}berani, gagah, dan cantik.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.22,0:11:44.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bahwa Pahlawan Meteor\Nadalah orang paling keren di dunia.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.21,0:11:48.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cuma aku saja yang tahu itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.81,0:11:53.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Curang.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.15,0:11:54.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.11,0:11:55.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Curang! Curang! Curang!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.82,0:11:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga tahu tentang Raja Iblis!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.78,0:12:01.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak, aku bohong!\NAku sama sekali tidak tahu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.57,0:12:05.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Aku tidak tahu!\N- Jadi yang benar yang mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.41,0:12:07.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pokoknya, dilarang menyerang tiba-tiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.54,0:12:08.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengar, Meteor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.81,0:12:09.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.59,0:12:16.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Target kita muncul.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.86,0:12:18.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia gede banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.85,0:12:20.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa kita bisa melawannya?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.30,0:12:24.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ini pahlawan yang kuat dan cantik.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.04,0:12:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.87,0:12:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Situasi darurat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.99,0:12:40.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terdeteksi makhluk tak dikenal!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.26,0:12:43.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lokasinya di bawah tanah Kota Mitsurugi,\Narea proyek kereta bawah tanah!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.62,0:12:46.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kategori bahaya sekitar level 3!\NIni monster yang kuat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.66,0:12:49.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kategori 3?\NSejak kapan ada makhluk seperti itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.71,0:12:51.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Para penyihir dekat area sekitar,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.08,0:12:52.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}segera ke lokasi!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.34,0:12:56.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong segera pasang barier\Ndi sekitar area pintu keluar!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.13,0:12:57.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana ini, Dorothy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.84,0:12:59.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini gawat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.60,0:13:03.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kategori 3,\NMana dan Minto saja akan kesulitan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.36,0:13:05.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setidaknya harus lima orang yang pergi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.20,0:13:07.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pokoknya, perintahkan para penyihir\Nuntuk cepat berkumpul!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.93,0:13:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu sebentar!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.08,0:13:11.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada yang sedang bertarung!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.85,0:13:14.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seimbang melawan kategori 3...\NTidak...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.86,0:13:16.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bahkan lebih kuat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.95,0:13:24.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meteor!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.83,0:13:29.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.46,0:13:36.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Beraninya menyerang Pahlawan Meteor!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.88,0:13:40.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan remehkan aku!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.54,0:13:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.77,0:13:51.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya mustahil!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.98,0:13:53.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ryusei-san!\NTolong lakukan sesuatu!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.97,0:13:54.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.94,0:13:56.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan buat celah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.19,0:13:58.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hellfire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.07,0:14:02.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Raja Iblis memang hebat!\NBisa diandalkan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.91,0:14:04.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada rencana?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.36,0:14:07.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hajar dia sekuat tenaga\Nsampai mulut besarnya menganga.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.20,0:14:10.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dimengerti!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.91,0:14:34.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Death Stinger!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.35,0:14:42.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serangannya menembus kulit luarnya\Nyang tebal seperti karet dari dalam!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.34,0:14:46.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Death Stinger, itu sihir kematian\Ntingkat tinggi...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.02,0:14:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Daya membunuh ini, dia masih sama\Nseperti saat menjadi Raja Iblis!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.42,0:14:55.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi ini kekuatan sihir Ryusei sekarang?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.25,0:14:58.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi ini... kekuatan Raja Iblis!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.53,0:15:03.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah kuduga, Raja Iblis\Nmemang ancaman bagi umat manusia.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.23,0:15:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pahlawan memang keren, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.68,0:15:12.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku jadi tak bisa berpikir apa pun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.72,0:15:14.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak! Curang!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.63,0:15:17.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa ada yang salah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.25,0:15:18.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak suka!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.31,0:15:19.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini kesempatan langkaku
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.59,0:15:21.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}karena Raja Iblis menjadi sangat lemah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.76,0:15:25.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ingin unggul darimu\Nyang sudah melemah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.10,0:15:28.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rencanaku ingin pamer kehebatan\Ndan kelapangan hati orang kuat!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.77,0:15:30.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak suka ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.40,0:15:33.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pahlawan ini sangat merepotkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.54,0:15:34.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak suka ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.85,0:15:36.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berisik!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.27,0:15:59.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa dari tadi kamu melamun?\NSekarang sudah siang.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.55,0:16:03.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tersadar, hati seorang pahlawan\Nyang ada dalam diriku...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.49,0:16:07.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masih mengigau, ya?\NSadarlah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.11,0:16:08.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hari ini kamu aneh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.96,0:16:10.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kemarin kamu mengalami apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.32,0:16:12.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ti-Tidak mengalami apa pun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.50,0:16:15.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mau kasih PR-ku ke guru dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.44,0:16:17.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hati-hati.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.70,0:16:19.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini, Sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.21,0:16:21.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}PR-ku sudah selesai.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.71,0:16:22.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.91,0:16:26.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu ingin bilang sesuatu padaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.84,0:16:30.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hm? Tidak ada...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.01,0:16:35.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hanaori-kun kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.22,0:16:37.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak tahu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.19,0:16:41.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa sikapnya begitu?\NDia sama sekali tidak berubah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.77,0:16:44.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi yang kemarin itu apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.21,0:16:46.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tingkahnya memang tidak seperti Raja Iblis.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.46,0:16:49.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan-jangan dia menipuku\Nlalu mau menguasai dunia?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.49,0:16:51.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, Ryusei!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.74,0:16:57.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dasar pembunuh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.11,0:16:58.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akhirnya kamu menunjukkan sifat aslimu, ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.86,0:17:00.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu salah paham.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.02,0:17:01.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku masih hidup.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.98,0:17:04.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Monster tomat menyerangnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.16,0:17:06.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Monster tomat?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.17,0:17:08.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kukira kamu betulan membunuhnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.61,0:17:10.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.01,0:17:11.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.31,0:17:13.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Suram.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.27,0:17:15.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Monster itu masih ada?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.47,0:17:17.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan pergi ke arah teriakan itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.57,0:17:19.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian evakuasi semua orang!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.54,0:17:21.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Takigawa, pakai ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.85,0:17:24.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pakai Pedang Suci Exlacibur ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.11,0:17:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami juga akan pergi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.32,0:17:32.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu sebentar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.56,0:17:33.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.08,0:17:38.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ryusei, menurutmu aku sebaiknya\Ntetap menjadi pahlawan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.69,0:17:40.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.24,0:17:44.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya, kemarin kamu bilang\Nbahwa pahlawan itu keren.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.08,0:17:48.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}caramu bertarung kemarin itu keren.\NItu benar,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.16,0:17:50.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi, maksudku bukan itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.34,0:17:52.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat kamu bertarung.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.94,0:17:55.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat kamu tertawa bersama teman-temanmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.38,0:17:58.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saat kamu makan\Ndengan wajah bahagia, semuanya...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.77,0:18:00.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Intinya, semuanya keren.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.78,0:18:01.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.98,0:18:05.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lakukan semua hal yang ingin kamu lakukan.\NKamu tidak perlu bimbang.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.73,0:18:07.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu terlalu repot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.21,0:18:09.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu tidak tahu, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.90,0:18:11.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Raja Iblis itu egois.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.91,0:18:17.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ka-Kamu bicara seenaknya...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.96,0:18:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mana!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.10,0:18:26.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Minto, kamu lama!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.70,0:18:28.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu... Jangan-jangan, itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.92,0:18:31.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pedang Suci Exlacibur?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.34,0:18:37.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Monster tomat itu namanya Tomath.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.49,0:18:40.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka monster dari duniaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.34,0:18:43.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Alien Eater.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.10,0:18:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka makhluk dari dunia lain\Natau planet lain, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.15,0:18:50.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi yang menyerang kali ini Tomath.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.82,0:18:55.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa ada dalang yang sedang mencoba\Nmenghubungkan sesuatu ke dunia kami?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.62,0:18:59.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untuk sementara, Tomath itu\Nmonster yang paling lemah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.26,0:19:03.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia tak punya kemampuan membunuh,\Njadi mungkin aman...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.54,0:19:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian baik-baik saja?\NSemuanya selamat?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.38,0:19:09.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meteor! Matsurika...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.84,0:19:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Matsurika!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.50,0:19:23.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ryusei!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.77,0:19:25.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Area di sini sudah kuatasi!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.84,0:19:29.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin semuanya sudah dikalahkan!\NKerja bagus!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.02,0:19:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik!\NAku pergi ganti baju dulu!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.54,0:19:34.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meteor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.57,0:19:39.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu pernah bilang keberadaan Raja Iblis\Nmelahirkan seorang pahlawan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.74,0:19:44.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin karena kepentinganku,\Naku sudah merenggut kehidupanmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.57,0:19:47.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sangat merasa bersalah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.97,0:19:49.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.30,0:19:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bersyukur karena kamu seorang pahlawan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.01,0:20:00.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Suaramu kedengaran.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.10,0:20:03.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pendengaran pahlawan sangat tajam.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.94,0:20:09.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kamu baik-baik saja, Gadis Bokong Persik?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.94,0:20:12.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih.\NMusuhnya cuma Tomath.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.92,0:20:14.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nyalimu boleh juga, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.70,0:20:15.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.78,0:20:19.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebenarnya aku ingin ini jadi rahasia,\Ntapi aku ini pahlawan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.49,0:20:21.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan angkuh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.33,0:20:23.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kamu pahlawan, berarti aku santa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.46,0:20:26.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia malah disindir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.71,0:20:28.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oi, Pahlawan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.98,0:20:29.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.88,0:20:31.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biar kuperingatkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.84,0:20:34.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soal kemunculan monster misterius.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.99,0:20:36.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berdasarkan penyelidikan kami,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.55,0:20:39.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}ada dalang yang sedang membuka pintu\Nmenuju dunia lain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.70,0:20:43.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Orang yang sedang kami cari...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.74,0:20:49.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akhirnya...\NAkhirnya terhubung.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.40,0:20:54.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan segera kembali,\Njadi tunggu aku, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.80,0:20:56.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Raja Iblisku tersayang!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.06,0:21:00.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sang Pahlawan yang Kembali.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.21,0:21:01.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Returner.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.87,0:21:05.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa itu? Keren!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.06,0:21:06.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang benar saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.76,0:22:44.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hai, Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.69,0:22:47.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi peramal bencana sepertinya berat, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.72,0:22:50.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, sangat suram.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.72,0:22:54.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kudengar kasus yang sedang\Nkalian tangani sekarang...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.44,0:22:56.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pahlawan yang bereinkarnasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.32,0:22:57.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.52,0:22:59.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terlebih, prediksinya benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.39,0:23:00.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Serius?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.78,0:23:04.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, yang dikirim ke daerah Mitsurugi itu
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.59,0:23:07.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}adalah Kuraishi Mana dan Takigawa Minto.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.28,0:23:11.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Penyihir yang kekuatan sihir apinya\Nselalu meledak dua kali lebih besar
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.42,0:23:15.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan penyihir serampangan yang semua\Nrapalannya berubah jadi bola api?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.81,0:23:18.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka berdua itu genius kebanggaan Oz.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.08,0:23:21.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi kita kekurangan orang, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.89,0:23:29.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kencan dungeon itu apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.30,0:23:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh? Apa maksudnya itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.18,0:23:33.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, aku asal ceplos.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.04,0:23:33.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seram!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.73,0:23:36.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kencan dungeon itu masih misteri.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.19,0:23:38.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang masih misteri itu isi kepalamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.29,0:23:40.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa kamu bilang?
